30. Bootstrap Carousel
→ Rasmlarni/contentlarni slideshow qilib ko‘rsatadi.

.carousel
→ Carousel container

.slide
→ slide animatsiyasi

data-ride="carousel"
→ avtomatik ishga tushiradi

.carousel-indicators
→ pastdagi nuqtalar

data-target="#myCarousel"
→ qaysi Carousel bilan ishlashini bildiradi

data-slide-to="0"
→ 1-slide
data-slide-to="1"
→ 2-slide
data-slide-to="2"
→ 3-slide

.carousel-inner
→ barcha slide'lar

.item
→ bitta slide

.active
→ hozir ochiq slide

.carousel-control
→ Previous/Next control

data-slide="prev"
→ oldingi slide

data-slide="next"
→ keyingi slide

.carousel-caption
→ slide ustidagi title/text

glyphicon-chevron-left
→ chap strelka

glyphicon-chevron-right
→ o‘ng strelka
